{"id":"vod_bf_16854","vodId":"16854","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"进击！巨人中学","name_cn":"进击！巨人中学","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第11集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-18/cf102df07d0e7d92c16fb95b14b0bec3.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《进击！巨人中学校》改编自谏山创原作、中川沙树负责作画的《进击的巨人》的同名衍生漫画。今天开始就是中学一年级了。将学校中，不对，是世界中的巨人驱逐出去。怀着这样的梦想与希望迎来开学典礼早晨的艾伦，立刻又睡过去了。被青梅竹马的三笠叫起来，在马上就要迟到时才飞奔出家门的艾伦在上学路上疾驰，途中遇到了萨莎、让、康尼等来自其他小学的人们。“这就是进击中学吗”艾伦等人仰望的是高耸入云的巨大墙壁和校门。进入这里的话，开学典礼就近在眼前了。但艾伦并不知道，这所学校有着人类决不能违逆巨人的校规？！？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动画,喜,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:55:41","classic":true,"classicRank":8,"franchise":"进击的巨人","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjijurenzhongxue/第11集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:01:52.386Z"}